# Workbench and engine output
Build/
*.pak
*.log
logs/
profile/

# The one secret this project has: a server's own files, including the
# Discord webhook URL. These belong in the server's profile directory,
# never in the repository. server/MrFrost/ holds the examples instead.
**/profile/MrFrost/
**/MrFrost/report.json
**/MrFrost/infomenu.json
**/MrFrost/factions.json
reports.log

# The examples under addon/server/ are the exception: they are tracked on
# purpose and ship with example content. Neither carries a webhook URL, and
# neither should ever be updated from a live server's copy.
!addon/server/MrFrost/*.json

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.bak
*~

# OS
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
